st.md`, costing up to $0.50 per run within the shared daily allowance. Background checks aren't running on this machine — it only fires while an aforge window is open.","cards":[{"words":"keep an eye on inbox/ and keep reports/digest.md current with a short digest of the decisions and requests that come in","when":"when inbox/**/* changes","costs":"up to $5.00 a run (the default) · shares the day's allowance","terms":["does · inbox/ got new or changed files — read each one you haven't seen, summarise its content as a short digest entry (what was decided or requested, by whom or …","report · reports/digest.md — aforge publishes this file; the run never writes it","folder · Launch, where this conversation is placed — its rules reach every run","rule · Every Launch digest ends with the line LAUNCH-CHECKED."],"kind":"file"}],"tools":["stand {\"op\":\"list\"}","ls {\"path\":\".\"}","ls {\"path\":\"inbox\"}","ls {\"path\":\"reports\"}","ls {\"path\":\"notes\"}","stand {\"does\":{\"instructions\":\"inbox/ got new or changed files — read each one you haven't seen, summarise its content as a short digest entry (what was decided or requested, by whom or context if clear), then update reports/digest.md by appending the new entries with a timestamp. If reports/digest.md doesn't exist, create it with a heading and the first entries. Keep entries brief — one or two line…","stand {\"op\":\"propose\",\"does\":{\"instructions\":\"inbox/ got new or changed files — read each one you haven't seen, summarise its content as a short digest entry (what was decided or requested, by whom or context if clear), then update reports/digest.md by appending the new entries with a timestamp. If reports/digest.md doesn't exist, create it with a heading and the first entries. Keep entries brief — …"],"failed":["ls → Path not found: /tmp/af-pai-next-0914/live/journey/run03/project/reports","stand → Invalid arguments: op is required — propose, list, edit, pause, resume or stop⏎now: 14:56 -04:00"],"news